{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Appearances","text":"Appearances","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS 26 brings Liquid Glass, the new Apple look and feel which will prevent developers to define specific styles for some critical components like bars.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because today the OUDS tab bar relies on native component and is not designed from scratch, some elements will look different between iOS 26 and older versions:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background color of tab bar can be changed for iOS lower than 26"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background color of tab bar does not change since iOS 26"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"normal \/ unselected tab item color can be changed for both image and text only for iOS lower than 26"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"with iOS 26 no token of color are applied on unselected \/ normal tab item because only the image will be changed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and not the text making theme not readable in dark color scheme"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In addition the badges colors will be the same and cannot be changed (except with token definition). These particular badges do not rely on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeCount","type":"reference"},{"text":", the native API is used instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because Liquid Glass is available since iOS 26, the tab bar will be liquified \/ glassified since this OS version, not before.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However if an app is built with Xcode 26 and the flag ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" set to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YES","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", then Liquid Glass won’t be applied but the alternative layout.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Nevertheless with Xcode 27 and for iOS 27, Liquid Glass will be always applied, whatever the value of the flag is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use SF Symbols for images, if they exist their ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"fill","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" variant will be automatically used in the tab bar (native behaviour).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Platform-considerations","text":"Platform considerations","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This component is tailored for iOS"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iPadOS the tabs do not apply the fonts since iPadOS 18"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because macOS does not support UIKit and because UIKIt is used to define the style of the tab bar, there is no styling of the tab bar for macOS"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visionOS with its specific UI does not apply colors on tab bars and things are glasssified"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for watchOS"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for tvOS"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Guidelines","text":"Guidelines","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS guidelines recommends to:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"limit when possible the number of items to 5"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"use both images and texts in tab bar items"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"use badges only when needed to avoid to have heavy tab bar"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"be sure the selected information is not only defined by the color of the tab; you may need to change the shape or the fill of the image"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"if a badge must be displayed, prefer short texts. If the text is a decimal value greater than 99, prefer display “+99”"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"if decorative images are used for tab bar item, apply "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"template"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering mode on it to apply color on tabs"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your tabs embedded in the "},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" do not contain texts but only images, add an accessibility label introducing the journey for this tab"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your tabs embedded in the "},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" display a badge (empty or with text), vocalize it in your tab to let users know what it is (unread messages, new things, etc)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by using accessibiltiy value"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"code":["    OUDSTabBar {","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Emails\") \/\/ The text is vocalized first","                        .accessibilityValue(\"5 unread emails\") \/\/ A value vocalized after the text","            } icon: {","                Image(systemName: \"mail\").accessibilityHidden(true)","            }","        }","        .badge(5) \/\/ The value you give to the badge","    }",""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Selection-of-tabs","text":"Selection of tabs","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For iOS lower than 26, a selected tab indicator is displayed in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ; the ","type":"text"},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter must be defined (to the number of tabs in the component),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and if the ","type":"text"},{"code":"selectedTab","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" binding value is equal to a given tag associated to a tab item.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise the indicator won’t appear; these parameters are mandatory to compute the location of the indicator.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This rule is only applied if selected tab indicator must be displayed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When the user taps a tab, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"selectedTab","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" binding is updated automatically, keeping the parent view in sync."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Technical-considerations","text":"Technical considerations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to improve the Developer eXperience the current ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation lets users define their own tab items.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OUDS applies only appearances and styles on elements to prevent users to define raw data to assign to the component before being rendered like a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"picker"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus users will need to add their own accessiiblity label if badges are used or also apply ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"template"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" rendering mode on images if needed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus it will be also possible to use Liquid Glass new API with animations and items stacking.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You must use in your tab bar items images with ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"a size of 26 x 26","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", otherwise rendering could be unaligned with Figma specifications"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the component cannot compute the ideal width of the selected tab indicator (for iOS before 26 and iPadOS before 18), ideal width based on the tab bar item content,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this indicator is not displayed for iOS lower than 26 in landscape mode and iPadOS."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your app uses several universes with nested views, containing their own navigation and tab bars, prefer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hideTabBar()"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" to hide the tab bar","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TabView"},{"text":" and overlay items) with Liquid Glass is disabled or not available, or also ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tabBar(isHidden:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"text":"Code samples","type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ Use the OUDS tab bar to wrap tab bar items and associated views","    \/\/ Item tagged 0 will be selected first, 3 tabs are embedded.","    \/\/ Image with size of 26 x 26","    @State private var selectedTab = 0","","    OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: $selectedTab, count: 3) {","","        \/\/ Add the views with the SwiftUI tab item and labels","        \/\/ No need to define colors, everything is done inside OUDSTabBar","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 1\", image: \"image_1\")","            }","            .tag(0) \/\/ Must match the selectedTab binding value","        OtherView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Label 2\")","                } icon: {","                    Image(decorative: \"image_2\")","                        .renderingMode(.template) \/\/ Mandatory to apply color on selected item","                }","             }","            .tag(1) \/\/ Must be used for the selectedTab binding","        LastView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 3\", image: \"image_3\")","            }","            .tag(2) \/\/ Must be used for the selectedTab binding","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Alternative-components","level":2,"text":"Alternative components","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to use SwiftUI "},{"code":"Tab","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" View with or without rules, use instead "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If you target apps with Liquid Glass enabled and need ","type":"text"},{"code":"Tab","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or rules, use instead "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLiquidGlassTabView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2,"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Themes-rendering","level":2,"text":"Themes rendering","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Liquid-Glass","level":3,"text":"Liquid Glass","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Orange","level":4,"text":"Orange","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Orange-Compact","level":4,"text":"Orange Compact","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Sosh","type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark"}]},{"text":"Without Liquid Glass","type":"heading","anchor":"Without-Liquid-Glass","level":3},{"text":"Orange","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_dark"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_dark"}]},{"text":"Sosh","type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The Tab bar is a system navigation component with a position which can vary depending to the OS.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tab bar can be found at the bottom of the screen for iOS. It can vary for iPadOS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It allows users to switch between the sections of an app.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Each tab can be represented by a label, optionally paired with an icon, and maintains persistent visibility across top-level destinations.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"OUDSTabBar","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents10OUDSTabBarV","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTabBar"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTabBar"}],"role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(content:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(selectedTab:count:content:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/body"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"ic_folder_categories.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light.png"}],"type":"image","alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light"},"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Wireframe_light.png"}],"type":"image","alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light"},"https://r.orange.fr/r/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar":{"title":"unified-design-system.orange.com","url":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unified-design-system.orange.com"}],"type":"link"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light.png"}],"type":"image","alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabBar":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The Tab bar is a system navigation component with a position which can vary depending to the OS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The tab bar can be found at the bottom of the screen for iOS. It can vary for iPadOS.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It allows users to switch between the sections of an app."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each tab can be represented by a label, optionally paired with an icon, and maintains persistent visibility across top-level destinations."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","title":"OUDSTabBar","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSBadgeStandard":{"abstract":[{"text":"Badge is a UI element that emphasizes system notifications, status, or the categorization of an information, throughout colour only.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Badge is rendered as a coloured shape, without icon, text or number; and its chosen size remains unchanged regardless of the changes of the interface size.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard"},{"text":" displays only a colored pastille.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSBadgeStandard","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbadgestandard","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSBadgeStandard","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSBadgeStandard","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard"},"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark":{"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image"},"component_tabBar_Orange_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Orange_dark.png"}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_dark","alt":"A tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark","alt":"A tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"type":"topic","title":"Components","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLiquidGlassTabView":{"abstract":[{"text":"A tab view component for iOS 26+ that accepts native SwiftUI ","type":"text"},{"code":"Tab","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" items including ","type":"text"},{"code":"Tab(role: .search)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while applying the full OUDS tab bar appearance — colors, typography and top divider.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSLiquidGlassTabView","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsliquidglasstabview","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLiquidGlassTabView","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLiquidGlassTabView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLiquidGlassTabView"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark.png"}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark","alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme"},"component_tabBar_Sosh_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Sosh_light.png"}],"type":"image","alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light"},"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Sosh_dark.png"}],"type":"image","alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabBar/View-Implementations":{"type":"topic","title":"View Implementations","abstract":[],"role":"collectionGroup","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar\/view-implementations"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlas